    {"parameters":{"content":"## Hygiene Recall Engine\nThree entry points: (1) appt ends -> checks if a future hygiene visit exists, else starts a 180-day recall tracked in Data Table \"dental_recalls\" + a visible calendar event; (2) a new appt is booked -> auto-stops any matching active recall; (3) a daily 9am scheduler advances due recalls through the 30/60/90/120-day SMS drip (Data Table replaces long Wait nodes per n8n best practice). Connect Google Calendar/Contacts/Gmail/Twilio credentials and set the two calendar IDs before activating.","color":4},"id":"e064fa48-c01d-4704-b8bc-88d0e8ffd4d4","name":"Sticky Note d65a05e4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[832,1648]}
